@startuml epa_frs
title epa_frs: EPA Facility Registry Service (Missouri state file)
start
:download state_combined_mo.zip once (30-day cache);
:for each CSV (one shard unit each):
facilities, organizations, NAICS;
note right: Python csv module: fused rows kept\nunder _fields instead of dropping good rows
:epa_frs_facilities / epa_frs_organizations / epa_frs_naics
(one JSON row per CSV row);
:dbt: one owner, parent company and primary NAICS per
geocoded facility (int_epa_frs__facilities);
:point-in-polygon against current dim_district
-> fct_district_facilities;
:non-government sites in each legislator's, U.S. representative's
or mayor's area, donor names matched -> fct_jurisdiction_businesses;
stop
@enduml
